//// set: ax-f1 — 推导式（omc 的数组构造调用）嵌在运算里：外层 sum / product 按定型次序逐元素展开、点号与换位只是打印形态、下标取元素 / 向量化内建（SKIP）
//// model: F10
model F10
Real y = (2 * {i * time for i in 1:3})[2];
end F10;
//// model: F11
model F11
Real y = sum({i * time for i in 1:3} * 2 + {1, 2, 3});
end F11;
//// model: F12
model F12
Real x[3] = 2 .+ {i * time for i in 1:3};
end F12;
//// model: F13
model F13
parameter Real p[3] = 2 * {i for i in 1:3};
end F13;
//// model: F14
model F14
Real x[3] = {i * time for i in 1:3} .- 1;
end F14;
//// model: F15
model F15
Real m[2, 2] = 2 * {{i * j * time for j in 1:2} for i in 1:2};
end F15;
//// model: F16
model F16
Real x[2] = {1, 2} .^ {i * time for i in 1:2};
end F16;
//// model: F17
model F17
Real y = product(2 * {i * time for i in 1:2});
end F17;
//// model: F18
model F18
Real x[3];
equation
x = 2 * {i * time for i in 1:3} + {time, 1, 2};
end F18;
//// model: F19
model F19
Real x[3](each start = 0);
equation
der(x) = -{i * time for i in 1:3};
end F19;
//// model: F110
model F110
Real x[3] = abs(2 * {i * time for i in 1:3});
end F110;
//// model: F111
model F111
Real x[3] = sin({i * time for i in 1:3}) * 2;
end F111;
//// model: F112
model F112
Real x[2];
equation
x = (2 * {i * time for i in 1:2}) / 3;
end F112;
//// model: F113
model F113
Real x[2];
equation
x = 3 / (2 * {i * time for i in 1:2});
end F113;
//// model: F114
model F114
Real y = sum(2 .+ {i * time for i in 1:3});
end F114;
//// model: F115
model F115
Real y = ({i * time for i in 1:3} .- 1)[1];
end F115;
//// model: F116
model F116
Real x[3];
equation
x = 2 * ({i * time for i in 1:3} + {1, 2, 3});
end F116;
//// model: F117
model F117
Real x[3];
equation
x = ({i * time for i in 1:3} + {1, 2, 3}) * time;
end F117;
//// model: F118
model F118
Real x[3];
equation
x = time * {i * time for i in 1:3} + 1 .* {i * time for i in 1:3};
end F118;
//// model: F119
model F119
Real x[3];
equation
for k in 1:3 loop
x[k] = (2 * {i * time for i in 1:3})[k];
end for;
end F119;
